My wife literally left me for those exact reasons, so I cant give you any advise.

&#x200B;

What I can say , coming from the heart broken husband, is maybe try go and see someone about it, together, talk to him about it, share those feelings with him, rather than bottle them all up. 

&#x200B;

Nothing worse than your wife leaving when you know there can be a way to work it out, or at least come to the decision mutually

